A refused quoted run with a lazy continuation stays literal

```
- > {#a
   .y}
.
<ul>
  <li>
    <blockquote><p>{<span class="tag"><strong>#a</strong></span>
.y}</p></blockquote>
  </li>
</ul>
```

```
